Z||000000||Old Lar||06-11-2001||01:00 PM||||I got to drive one this weekend..Who says 2 seater cars won't sell?  Leather seats, 240 HP, 4 clinder engine, six speed transmission, fat tires, convertible and red lines at 9000 rpm.  I didn't take it any way near 9000, the car had 780 miles on it and it was a friends new car.  50 mph in 6, is 2500 rpm and it still has torque to pull away.  It handles very nice.  However a $34K sticker with dealers trying to get +$4k puts it out of my fun toy price range.<P>If GM (Pontiac) wasn't so short sighted, a Fiero for 2002.<P>||||reg||14
